<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are all at home in the Father’s house...</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We have perfect peace in the Father’s house...</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We are loving God in the Father’s house...</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We smile all day long in the Father’s house...</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>We are satisfied in the Father’s house...</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>We love Jesus Christ in the Father’s house...</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Bring Your children back to the Father’s house...</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
